-- A call script for examples/map.lang (kit slice K4a0): a state with a Map field.
-- Set two books, read them and a missing id, then set a book to zero.
100 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setBook 3 5u
101 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setBook 1 7u
102 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb book 3
103 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb book 9

-- A set of the zero value removes the key.
104 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb setBook 3 0u
105 0x00000000000000000000000000000000000000bb book 3
